        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate ongoing competition from ERP and supply chain management (SCM) applications vendors and from business application software vendors that may broaden their solution offerings by internally developing or acquiring or partnering with independent developers of supply chain planning and execution software.",
